# walled_rails_offset.cam/geometry.part — the land, one face at z=-8, and twelve
# regions standing 8mm above it. Chorded from land.svg (one evenodd `land`
# path, one evenodd `raised` path with data-height="8"; arcs to 0.01mm of
# sagitta; y flipped, SVG being y-down). A raised region is a ProfileBoss
# (CW) whose top is the stock top; every land edge it shares is a WALL —
# derived, as Phase 29 derives it, never drawn.
